  "payload": {
    "subject": "修复 ColumnSelector.restore() 未捕获 Http2.get 异常导致按钮权限不显示",
    "context": "#004",
    "content": "## 问题\n\n```\nbaseService.js:357 Uncaught (in promise) Error: 出错啦\n    at HttpHandler.errorHandler (baseService.js:357:19)\n    at HttpHandler.invoke (baseService.js:450:25)\n    at async Proxy.restore (components.js:4455:56)\n```\n\nHTTP 修复后 fetch 不再 Failed，但 `/settings/get-by-key` API 在天津宏观世纪后端不存在，返回非 200 → `errorHandler` 抛出异常。\n\n## 根因\n\n`components.js:4455` 的 `restore()` 方法：\n```javascript\nlet storeColumns = JSON.parse((await Http2.get('/settings/get-by-key', { key: this.key() },null,true))?.value || '[]');\n```\n\n`Http2.get` 在非 OK 响应时 throw Error，`|| '[]'` 兜底逻辑永远走不到。\n\n## 修复\n\n用 try-catch 包裹，异常时降级为默认空数组：\n```javascript\n// 改前\nasync restore() {\n    let storeColumns = JSON.parse((await Http2.get('/settings/get-by-key', { key: this.key() },null,true))?.value || '[]');\n    // ...\n}\n\n// 改后\nasync restore() {\n    try {\n        let storeColumns = JSON.parse((await Http2.get('/settings/get-by-key', { key: this.key() },null,true))?.value || '[]');\n        if (storeColumns.length == 0) return;\n        // ... 原有逻辑不变\n    } catch (e) {\n        // 嵌入式模式下 settings API 不可用，静默降级\n        return;\n    }\n}\n```",
    "files": [
      "caikuangzi.fenluwebproject/trunk/Web/Web/v2/libs/components.js"
    ],
    "actions": [
      "components.js restore() 方法加 try-catch 包裹 Http2.get 调用",
      "SVN 暂存",
      "发送 REVIEW 给 Reviewer"
    ],
    "deadline": null
  }
}
